Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《六人行》前情提要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Previously on Friends:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要告诉钱德  我遇见了理查  哪个理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you don't tell Chandler.I ran into Richard. Which Richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我前男友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纪念日发生这种事  真是再扫兴不过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the worse thing that can happen on an anniversary ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你最后还是决定  要跟钱德说理查的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh good! All right, so you decided to tell him about the Richard thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能再跟他见面  你不能对我发号施令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can not ever see him again! You can't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣  刚才不就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so funny, because I think I just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到我的双胞手了  什么是双胞手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have found my identical hand twin. What's an identical hand twin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个人的手跟我一模一样  我要变成百万富翁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A guy with my identical hands. I'm gonna be a millionaire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当真以为我想跟你上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you actually thought I wanted to have sex with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚对你其实也很尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, last night was embarrassing for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是没有那么容易尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't embarrass that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,登记柜台应该在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think the check-in is that way. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子最喜欢我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, kids love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  你们来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Phoebe! Hi. You guys are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你这是  去参加化妆舞会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yay! What'd you do? Did you go to a costume party?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来猜  你是扮庞丘维亚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me guess. Um, Pancho Villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是鲍伯塞吉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're Bob Saget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,庞丘维亚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pancho Villa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你在说什么啊   我不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about, Pheebs? I don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你偷画我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! You drew on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.85,0:01:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你弄湿我的裤子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you wet my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪种派对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, what kind of party was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打从下飞机就是这样子  你实在是太过分了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I've been walking around like this since the plane! I can—you have so crossed a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  等等  男厕在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash, wait. The men's room is that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这已经是第三次  那女士接我手玩  结果赢钱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's like the third time that lady's won on a machine I was playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赌她一定是那种人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I bet she's one of those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,间谍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}M-M-Mole people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不是  是跟赌人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, a lurker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟赌人是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. What's a lurker?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你玩赌博机  没有赢钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay when you're playing a machine and it hasn't paid out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟赌人等你放弃后来接手玩  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a lurker waits for you to give up and then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀你灭口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kills you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  他们半路杀进来偷走本来你会中的大奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, they swoop in and steal your jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道这种事  我褓姆以前就干这行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know about this? My nana used to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就是用这收入  帮我付舞蹈-空手道的学费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's how she paid for my dance-Karate lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舞蹈-空手道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dance karate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  那是种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it's a deadly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美丽却致命的运动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but beautiful sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弄不掉  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It won't come off. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弄不掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It won't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  瑞秋  你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Rash, are-are-are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不确定  其实我弄掉了  又自己再画回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, actually I took it off then I drew it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们到了  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey-hey-hey you made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友是谁  他真辣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's your friend? He's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢夸奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德跟我说过了  电影的事我很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I talked to Chandler, and I'm sorry about the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要也罢  我找到我的双胞手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't need it anymore. I found my identical hand twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的双胞手  那个人的手掌跟我完全一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My identical hand twin. The person whose hands are exactly like mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是金矿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠那个赚不了钱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That won't make you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你这样想也无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, if that's how you feel about it, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到时我盖了手掌形的大厦  你们谁都休想来住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None of you will live with me in my hand-shaped mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你例外  大拇指给你住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except, uh, you. You can live in the thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第24集  拉斯维加斯之旅（下集）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E24  The One In Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  宝贝  加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, baby, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挡都挡不住  摩妮卡  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am on fire! See you later Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   钱德  你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait Chandler, What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看呢  我要回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's it look like? I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我只是下来玩一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I’m sorry, I was just playing for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算要跟你说  若你不让我和理查再见面  我答应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was trying to find you to tell you that, look if you don't want me to see Richard again, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对我没有任何意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  我又不是瞎子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他是你追求的真爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know he's the love of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘了那些什么要回家的事  我们来庆祝周年纪念日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's forget about going home stuff and celebrate our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,袋子里是空的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, this is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要搞得很戏剧化  可是我又讨厌打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I wanted to make a dramatic scene, but I hate packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh, hey. Where's the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高高的  深色头发  手掌跟我一模一样  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's kinda tall, dark hair, hand looks exactly like this? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道什么手掌的  不过在我之前的发牌员去上厕所了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know about the hands, but the guy that was here before me just went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  我很忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing? Very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我有个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, hello. I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用你们的笔  画我朋友的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I used your pen to draw on my friend's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画了胡子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A beard and a mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  她不以为然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, she didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  对啊  那其实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. It's like-Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用化妆品盖不过去  我们试过所有方法都去不掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}umm well make-up didn't cover it. and we've tried everything to get it off and nothing's worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这要怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  多谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这个墨水擦不掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's not coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  那他还说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What else did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他觉得我很逗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, he said he thought I was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你听我说  我们下楼去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look. Let's just go downstairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好玩   你就会忘记这回事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we'll have some fun, and you will forget all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休想  罗斯  我这张脸像这样绝对不出房门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, no! There's no way I am leaving this room looking like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啦  也没有那么难看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Rach. It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我变成人体涂鸦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I am a human doodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别因为一个白痴在你脸上乱画  而阻碍你玩乐的权利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Just because some idiot drew on your face doesn't mean you shouldn't have any fun! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.03,0:06:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且又没人会看你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And besides, hey-hey-hey no one is even gonna look at you. Okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里可是赌城  怪人一大堆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Vegas. Hello? There are tons of other freaks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有一大堆怪人  你不算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are tons of freaks here. No other. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走啦  我发誓  没人会注意到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. No one will notice. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  是有一些人指指点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, There was some staring and pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我得喝点酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Okay, I need a, I need a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰箱里的酒都太贵了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey y'know, they-they really overcharge you for that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是谁在乎呢  因为我请客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But who cares, because it's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一点酒还真不少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is one big drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要吃夏威夷果仁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Macadamia nut?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个果仁还真值钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, wow! That's some pricey nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很喜欢吃果仁  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really like those macadamia nuts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟赌人  走开啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out of here, you lurker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go on, get!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  你们和好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. You made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我没办法一直生他的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I couldn't be mad at him for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有钱德的爱  她就不能活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, She couldn't live without the "Chand love."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去开房间啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有房间  我知道  快去用啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have one. I know. Use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可得好好照顾你的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-oh-oh, yeah! That's right. Take good care of those babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么  我是乔伊啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me? It's me. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秀手的那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, the hand guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么处理双胞手的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so what are we gonna do about this hand twin thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用处理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我拥有上帝的赐礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you and I have been given a gift.Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得要好好利用  好比手部模特儿或是变魔术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to do something with it. Like hand modeling. Huh? Or-or magic! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太空总署一定也想找我们聊聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know NASA's gonna want to talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回去  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to get back to work. Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以自己组秀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can have our own show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把手掌合在一起  大家一定超爱看的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know we can clap our hands together. People will love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还替我们写了一首主题曲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I wrote a song for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This hand is your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This hand is my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那是你的手才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, that's your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  是我的手才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, wait, it's my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了  你还没听到副歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's okay. But you haven't even heard the chorus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在看起来  好像我姑婆茉莉儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm starting to look like my great-aunt, Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  其实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用不着下楼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't have to go downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在房间里就可以赌啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can bring Vegas up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快  来啊来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, come on. come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来玩黑杰克  来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll play some blackjack. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,13点  再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thirteen. Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,23  爆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这间赌场23点最大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is what we play to at this casino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了10美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You win $10!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我押了20美元  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet 20. right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我的小钱钱买双新鞋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A new pair of shoes for the Chan-Chan man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子还没看过有这么旺的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never seen a roll like this  in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  你说对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次要押几号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do I want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  8号  还是6号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, ah umm, ah, a 8. Ah, a 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选一个啦  你只有这个任务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pick a number! That is your only job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8号  8号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}8. 8! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你中了这一把  晚餐就请在场的各位吃牛排\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you get this one, we buy everybody here a steak dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8号  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}8! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的要请他们吃牛排\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not really gonna buy these people steak dinners are we? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假的  那就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次要押几号  再硬押个8\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, What do I want now? Try a hard eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  4加4啦  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Two fours.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千万要把握住她  你太幸运了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you let her go. You're a lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你   醉赌徒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Mr. Drunken Gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   如果你中了这一把  我们就租下这里最大的套房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, You get this, and, uh, we get the biggest suite in the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的我们是我和她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We get the biggest suite in the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这里最大的套房来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, The biggest suite in the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  我都忘记我们在吵什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!! I love you! I can't even remember what we were fighting about!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我和理查吃中饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's because I had lunch with Rich
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也忘了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次要押几号   再硬押次8\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What now? Uh, another hard eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬押8  简单8才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hard eight? Let's call it easy eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这样吧  如果这次再中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, I'll tell you what. You roll another hard eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚就在这里结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we get married here, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Come on! Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好戏才正要上场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just got interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再赢一次8  我们今晚就在这里结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You roll another hard eight and we get married here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的  是啊  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious?! Yes. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不曾这样爱过一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never loved anybody as much as I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不曾这样爱过一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never loved anybody as much as I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  如果再出8就是天意  我们今晚就结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, So if an eight comes up, we take it as a sign and we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay.okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  8号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hard eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个是4  另一个呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a four. And where's the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,掉到桌子底下了  通通不许动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It went under the table. Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找那边  我找这边  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look that way, I look this way. All right! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here it is, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一半4  一半5\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That could be 4 or 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是4\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这样觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  又没赢到钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, lost again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  我们去外面解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. You and me. Outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想看到  你美丽的金发少了一撮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wouldn't want you to lose a chunk of that pretty blond hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假装没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士  你跟赌的日子结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay lady, your lurking days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  从现在开始  我要抢先你一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, from now on everyone you lurk, I'm gonna lurk first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你找谁下手  我都会捷足先登\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You move on to someone else, I'm gonna be one step ahead of you ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次都不放过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都会紧紧跟着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then I'll be on your ass every hour of every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到星期一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...till Monday...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我那天要回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because that's when I go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何时要回家  也是星期一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When do you leave? Also Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几点  说不定能共乘计程车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What time? Maybe we can share a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得再去买牌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  还要再来点酒  你等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and we also need more, um, drinks. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whup, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  赌城吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Vegas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We would like some more alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  再来点啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and y'know what else? We would like some more beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我竟然忘了拨号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I forgot to dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是送酒来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That must be our alcohol and beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  是乔伊  我爱乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. It's Joey! I love Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I love Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊跟鸭子住一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey lives with a duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听我说  我需要帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look-look-look you guys, I need some help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁去叫我那双胞手合作点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone has to convince my hand twin to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去  不管你有什么需要  找我就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll do it. Hey, Whatever you need me to do, I'm your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  喔  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我很好  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rash'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  我很好  你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm doing good, baby. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  别再让她喝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, Don't let her drink anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那颗夏威夷果仁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's that macadamia nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  是别的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, something else. Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你现在要干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oops! All right, So, what do you wanna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要离开这房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna get out of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想念楼下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I…I really miss downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  要我离开这问房间  只有一个方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know what? There is only one way I am leaving this hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  抱歉  先生  你脸上有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck to you. Sir, you've got a little something right here....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了  我终于赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won! I won! I finally won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我赢才对  那是我的硬币\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won! That was my quarter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  还给你  滚吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine! Here! Take a hike, toots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生  不好意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位小姐用我的硬币玩  这是我赢的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This lady played my quarter. This is my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  真的是这样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that true, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖毒品给小孩  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sells drugs to kids. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她卖毒品给小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She sells drugs to kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的硬币\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was my quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那硬币是她的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it her quarter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等吃晚餐再聊如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about we talk about this over dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  小姐  请你出去  不  不  你不能逮捕我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, lady, you're out of here. No! No, you can't arrest me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我才不要重回火坑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No!! I won't go back! I won't go back to that hell hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要把你带出去而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just taking you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  一定要凑齐四样东西  我们才能结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't get married until I get something old, something new, something borrowed and something blue.Okay,Okay! all right, Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是蓝色的  而且也是新的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here's something, Here's something blue and new.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真有效率  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so efficient. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  不  不  不  还不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go. No-no-no! wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要旧的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need something old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我皮夹里有个保险套  我从12岁放到现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, I have a condom in my wallet that I've had since I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以用啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该不能用了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  现在只剩借来的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now we just need something borrowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就把这毛衣拿走  这是偷窃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here, just take this. That's stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到时再还回来就是了  塞进你的洋装里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we'll-we'll bring it back! Just put it under your dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  先结婚再怀孕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. One thing at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要玩吗  不要  我半毛钱都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna play? No, I don't really have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是时候未到而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不玩就不能坐在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't sit here if you don't play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是瑞吉娜佛兰姬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. My name is Regina Phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是生意人  这趟是来出差的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a businesswoman in town on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我的名片吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like to see my card?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名片夹到哪儿去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did I do with my file-a-facts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是忘在B会议室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I must've left it in Conference Room B.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,14点 再加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fourteen. Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我得说两位的手一模一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. May I just say that you two gentlemen have the exact same hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个模子刻出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在商业界做了这么久  从来没看过这种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I've never seen anything like that in the business world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佛兰姬女士  以局外人的身份  我能请教你一个问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Miss Phalange, may I ask you a question as an impartial person at this table?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你别再说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿不愿意花大钱  去看手掌一模一样的两个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wouldn't you pay good money to see identical hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种娱乐性的演出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...showcased in some type of an entertainment venue?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你愿意离开  我就把手砍下来送你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you leave now, I will chop off my hand and give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是才把你赶出去了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't I just throw you out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你赶出去的是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you threw out Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是瑞吉娜佛兰姬女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Regina Phalange. Phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  你别闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你把他也带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please take him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  别这样嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me? Oh, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't let him do this. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的双胞手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm your hand twin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  登记结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. One marriage, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We want to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有婚礼正在进行  先请坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there's a service in progress. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是结婚进行曲  听了  有没有吓到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The "Wedding March." Does that freak you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  因为那是毕业歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, only because that's the graduation song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我们要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is it. We're gonna get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你真的想结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  罗斯太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Mrs. Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  瑞秋先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello, Mr. Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. Okay.
